  "body": "# Audacity 4.0.1 release notes\r\n\r\nMany of these fixes come from community contributors. Thank you all!\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n- Export multiple: export each track, or each labelled region, to its own file (#11136)\r\n- Portable Windows version that runs without installation (#11932)\r\n- Restored missing Audacity 3 keyboard shortcuts (#12062)\r\n- \"Open in file manager\" on the Cloud projects tab (#11801)\r\n- Clickable carousel dots on the Welcome screen (#11247, by @danielmolinas)\r\n- Liquid Glass app icon on macOS (#11923, by @JoshBashed)\r\n\r\n## Accessibility\r\n\r\n- The timeline and the track vertical rulers are now part of keyboard navigation (#11367, #11368)\r\n- Opening the Effects panel focuses the \"Add effect\" button (#11416)\r\n- Toast notifications are announced by screen readers and reachable by keyboard (#11645)\r\n\r\n## Bug fixes\r\n\r\n- Fixed project corruption after a failed save (#12296)\r\n- Fixed clips being messed up when converting .aup3 projects (#12209)\r\n- Fixed opening projects and files with non-ASCII characters in their name or folder (#11973, #11976, #12004, #12057, by @jonata)\r\n- Fixed other non-ASCII text issues: presets with Unicode names, starting a new project, and the input device always being the system default on Windows (#8267, #11468, #12107)\r\n- Fixed Audacity failing to launch with Windows Smart App Control enabled (#12167)\r\n- Fixed the AppImage failing to install or start on some Linux distributions (#10135, #12093, by @kfl; #11915)\r\n- Fixed crash when opening the Effect menu in German (#12025)\r\n- Fixed \"Audacity quit unexpectedly\" dialogs popping up during plugin validation (#11427)\r\n- Fixed VST3 setting changes being reverted on playback start (#11892)\r\n- Fixed typing values into effect controls (#11643, #11668)\r\n- Dragging clips and labels across tracks is faster and no longer crashes, and dragging a duplicated clip onto its original no longer makes it disappear (#12097, #12081 by @jonata)\r\n- Realtime effect windows stay open on edits and undo/redo, and undo/redo is faster with many effects (#12187)\r\n- Fixed clips flickering when selecting after applying an effect (#11145)\r\n- Fixed the playhead drifting from bars and beats above 120 BPM (#11925)\r\n- The view no longer jumps on pause or double-click, and selecting a track by its header no longer moves the playhead (#11148, #12013, #11972 by @jonata)\r\n- Fixed new labels being placed at the wrong position, and the first label's name not being editable right away (#11682 by @RiccardoCampo, #10083)\r\n- No more \"-9996 Invalid device\" error dialog when input monitoring can't open the device (#12070, by @jonata)\r\n- Fixed exported file names being truncated (#11966)\r\n- Fixed opening files dropped on the macOS Dock icon (#11961)\r\n- Fixed upper-case extensions such as .WAV not being recognized on Linux (#12007)\r\n- Fixed shortcuts not being saved (#11903)\r\n- Fixed tooltips on the gain, volume and graphic EQ sliders (#10410, #11841)\r\n- Fixed the meter dB range not being translated (#11940 by @jonata)\r\n- Cloud: fixed resuming uploads after a lost connection, mono audio imported as stereo, and broken project audio previews (#11609, #12155, #11568)\r\n- Cloud: no more redundant sync dialog on save, error when overwriting a local copy, or half-initialized window after a failed open (#11373, #11460, #11374)\r\n",
